  "served_url": "/promotions/xuw/rp/tenth-ultimoxuw-interview-hardkore-2003-11-13.html",
  "source": "XUW's own site, www.ultimoxuw.com/interviews/hardkore.htm (Wayback capture 20041016114606).",
  "collection": "0003",
  "notes": "An in-character interview: hardkore answers the fed's interview questionnaire and questions in the gimmick's voice throughout. He says DJ recruited him and Al Crud (\"dj come runin out he goe 'hardkore hardkore its time u an crud showed peeps how wrestlin is done'\"), and calls Big Ted's Arm his protege (\"big teds arm is hardkores protege hes goin to conquer the uwf for hardkore\"). The interviewer, Blake Wolfson, signs the closing note."
 }
